{"title": "War Pick +1", "pageid": 3369, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/War_Pick_+1", "categories": ["Equipment", "Weapons", "Melee weapons", "Martial weapons", "War Picks", "Uncommon items", "Sources of Piercing damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warpick_PlusOne_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Warpick_PlusOne_Icon.png/300px-Warpick_PlusOne_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/4/4e/Warpick_PlusOne_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"War Pick +1 image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Warpick_PlusOne_Icon.png/300px-Warpick_PlusOne_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Warpick_PlusOne_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">War Pick +1</span></strong> is an uncommon, lightly enchanted (+1) variant of the <a href=\"/wiki/War_Picks\" title=\"War Picks\">War Picks</a> family of weapons. It is a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">martial melee weapon</a> wielded in one hand.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>When swung, the arc of this weapon perfectly matches the curve of its beak-like pick.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/40px-D8_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/53px-D8_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/D8_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d8 + 1 (2~9) + <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Roll#Modifiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Roll\">Strength modifier</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a></span> </div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/War_Picks\" title=\"War Picks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/War_Picks_Icon.png/25px-War_Picks_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/War_Picks_Icon.png/38px-War_Picks_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/War_Picks_Icon.png/50px-War_Picks_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"War Picks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/War_Picks_Icon.png/25px-War_Picks_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/War_Picks_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/War_Picks\" title=\"War Picks\">War Picks</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/38px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Dippable Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Enchantment: <b>+ 1</b></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/38px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"One-Handed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png/25px-Handedness_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Handedness_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> One-Handed</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dippable\" title=\"Dippable\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/38px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Dippable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png/25px-Dippable_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Dippable_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dippable\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dippable\">Dippable</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wik